{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TicTacBlow is a modern take on classic tic-tac-toe (noughts and crosses, X's and O's).  TicTacBlow is the familiar, family-friendly, turn-based, territory capture game we all played as children, but with new gameplay mechanics that provide additional choices and create fresh opportunities for clever strategies and extended play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build settlements to capture territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form squads (e.g. 3-in-a-row) to meet board completion requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWERFUL TOOLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend resources to gain powerful weapons and tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemy settlements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine the field to prevent enemy advancement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire the ultimate weapon: *NUKES* for dramatic reversals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY CARDS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck of unique cards adds elements of luck and strategy.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate power-up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal, sabotage, and destroy the enemy.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold cards in your hand until the timing is just right!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play multiple cards in a single turn for combined effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRADE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade resources at the market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your inventory to unlock your own unique strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different board biomes offer varying resource prospects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTEND</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend the fun with multiple boards in a single game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory and score accumulate across all boards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play board sizes ranging from 3x3 all the way to 10x10.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > PLAY WITH FRIENDS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local: two players on the same display.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online: two players through the cloud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN: Host and connect on local LAN networks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server: Run your own server for private gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Century","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3717160/847233a7dbc31310fa2f0451a9963d2f35300462.jpg"},{"name":"Fallout Shelter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3717160/0fa5af0eee31d53fb7c3214f34eda5c4dcc0af6a.jpg"},{"name":"8-Gun Salute","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3717160/d022027f64dc0432be36bb45efa15af13afa7c75.jpg"},{"name":"Everywhere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3717160/a77b7983871072cfcb10b0cb1071a55defe59b2b.jpg"},{"name":"Mother Lode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3717160/56564965f6c39d36211fba4d5a230d88ae97709c.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717160?t=1755817562","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717160?t=1755817562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717160/5d7017559f09b90e12f83278